# Build context hygiene for infra/Dockerfile.
#
# The first rule is the important one: secrets must never enter the image
# layers. Everything else keeps the context small so builds stay fast.

# ── secrets (non-negotiable) ────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*

# ── VCS / editor ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git
.gitignore
.vscode
.idea
.agents

# ── build output and caches (rebuilt inside the image) ──────────────────────
node_modules
.next
dist
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# ── local-only infrastructure and data ──────────────────────────────────────
infra/compose.local.yml
backups
.cache
data/*.ndjson

# ── documentation and tests (not needed at runtime or build) ────────────────
docs
tests
*.md
